<title>UK: San Paolo sets warrants on Italian shares.</title>
<headline>San Paolo sets warrants on Italian shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Instituto Bancario San Paolo di Torino Spa, London has issued European-style call and put warrants on Italian ordinary shares, joint lead managers Instituto Bancario San Paolo di Torino Spa, Nordbanken Stockholm and Intersim Spa said.</p>
<p>San Paolo said that the tranche consists of two call and two puts on the following five individual shares for a total of 20 warrants: ENI, Edison, Carraro, Telecom Italia Mobile and Pirelli.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE 12.MAY.97	PAYDATE 05.FEB.97	LISTING LUX</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
